{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54248","headline":"六合怀古诗 废如归馆 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 废如归馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅况凄凄南北涯，每投新馆便如归。\n当年盛（《光绪志》作「胜」）事今何在，却使扬朱泪满衣。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》题注：「《嘉定志》：如归馆在东门，南北若馆驿然。\n郏滂时已废。\n」〖2〗《光绪志》诗末注：「如归馆在东门北。\n」〖3〗《金陵诗徵》卷三五题注：「在东门外。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}